==Overview==
The '''Toxic Mutant Toilet''' is an enemy that was added in update 67 (Part 1}. It has a very high amount of health and appears in the very late game. It appears in [[Nightmare Mode]], [[Endless Mode|Endless mode]] and [[Abysmal Mode (Halloween Event)|Abysmal Mode]] and [[Turkey Town|Turkey Town.]] It has an acid gun that it can use to stun units, and also has a buzzsaw which is also used to stun.
==Waves==

==== Nightmare: ====
Wave 43: x1

Wave 46: x1

Wave 48: x1

==Abilities==
*Buzzsaw Attack: Attacks a unit with its buzzsaw, stunning it for 3 seconds.
*Toxic Shoot: Shoots out toxic acid, stunning multiple units for 4 seconds.
== Strategy ==
*The Toxic Mutant Toilet has a lot of health, so you should use high DPS units to defeat this enemy such as the [[Upgraded Titan Speakerman]] or [[Jetpack Speakerman|Jetpack Speakerman.]]
*The Toxic Mutant Toilet will stun units very quickly, so you should use [[Medic Cameraman]] or [[Camera Repair Drone]] to un-stun units stunned by this enemy.
*Upgraded Titan Speakerman can block up to 2 stuns, making it very useful to block your other units from being stunned.
*[[Upgraded Titan Cameraman]] can block 1 stun, which can also block other units from being stunned.
*The [[Mech Cameraman|Mech Cameraman,]] [[TV Woman|TV Woman,]] and Upgraded Titan Cameraman levels 5-6 can slow down this enemy.
== Trivia ==
*The Toxic Mutant Toilet is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Mafia_Skibidi_Toilet?so=search#Upgraded_Mafia_Skibidi_Toilet Upgraded Mafia Skibidi Toilet.]
*He is not a mutant toilet even that his name contains that word
